      "dataset_observation": "FRS 2024-25 spine; capital gains amounts redrawn from HMRC Table 3 (size of gain by taxable income, 2024-25) with asset types from HMRC Tables 7 and 8, gains qualifying for Business Asset Disposal Relief and Investors' Relief imputed from HMRC Table 4, and gain carriers conditioned on wealth through a mass-conserving support split (microcosm#1045); the sub-exempt remainder drawn from the Advani-Summers within-band distribution (microcosm#970); household weights calibrated to 1,090 targets for 2024-25, among them HMRC's CGT totals, size bands, age, region, gains by taxable income band (Table 3) and the BADR bands (Table 4)",
      "dataset_notes": "Carries capital_gains, capital_gains_residential_property (the residential schedule) and capital_gains_badr (gains qualifying for Business Asset Disposal Relief or Investors' Relief); no carried-interest column. The build's projection fence bounds the gainers that uprating carries over the frozen exempt amount by 2030 at 6.7k, against HMRC's 73k in the GBP 3,000 to 5,999 band.",
